- NFS Server -
NFS Export
The export on the NFS server, for example /srv/ps2, or / for the whole server. RiptOPL speaks NFS version 4.0 on port 2049.
NFS Writes
Off: RiptOPL only reads the export, whatever the server allows, keeps game settings next to its own and uses no VMC there. On: renaming, deleting, saving and VMCs on the export, where the server allows it.
%d: Cannot connect to NFS server. It must offer NFS version 4.0 on port 2049.
